{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791944700, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T02:25:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T02:26:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791944760, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:25:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 63809, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "我住南港，在走路時常有騎著ubye的人跟行人爭道，而且沒有減速，這對行人來說很危險，請問市長解決辦法", "display_name": "南港代表 No.63,809", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:25:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24329, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "從南京松江站騎自行車道到中山站，自行車道沿途都是附近大樓上班族抽煙，真的很痛苦！沈市長靠你的智慧了！", "display_name": "中山代表 No.24,329", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:25:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30700, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "南港展覽館每次辦大型展演，下班尖峰時間周邊就塞爆，原本5分鐘的車程變成20分鐘，希望沈市長幫忙改善！", "display_name": "南港代表 No.30,700", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T02:25:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5198, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "育兒", "content": "我有時間陪小孩，但是聽不懂國小五年級的女兒在說什麼，兒子叫我陪玩玩具，我不知道要怎麼玩。希望有人可學", "display_name": "大安代表 💎季玲💎", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 24329, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.24,329", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 30700, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.30,700", "district": "nangang", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 5198, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 💎季玲💎", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 12140, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "d